## Operating machine/technical hours/workshop

Industrial holdings of Lugano (AIL) SA — open position in Lugano/Muzzano (TI).

AIL SA Casella postale 6901 Lugano Centre Via Industria 2 6933 Muzzano Tel. 058 470 70 www.ail.ch
• info@ail.ch About us: We are a dynamic company in the energy sector and in the supply of drinking water, evolving and with a strong focus on innovation and development of people. We are looking for a passionate and motivated person for the role of Operator/Technical hours/or workshop What you will do concretely: on the basis of the instructions of your manager, you will ensure the activities of your competence regarding the Officina group and in particular:
• precision mechanics and metal construction;
• revision of shipyard boxes, temporary electricity and drinking water connections;
• assembly, management and repair of material and technical means, with related administrative practices (low voltage weapon, locks, cells, etc.). Who are you?
• you have an AFC as an operator/hour in electrical automation or training;
• preferably you have basic knowledge of the main welding techniques and machining of precision mechanics;
• you have a strong sense of responsibility, reliability and flexibility;
• you are dynamic and motivated in the performance of the activity;
• you can use the Office 365 package;
• you have the license to conduct category B;
• you have the licence for forklift (category R1/R2);
• you are available at the picket service;
• you have Swiss citizenship or a residence permit. What we offer:
• a varied and interesting activity, becoming part of a society in continuous evolution;
• a collaborative work environment, with ample space to bring ideas and innovation;
• flexibility and support to reconcile professional and personal life;
• possibility of improvement and continuing training;
• Contractual conditions, insurance and insurance interest. Attachment documents:
• motivational letter;
• complete dossier of curriculum vitae, diplomas and work certificates;
• copy of the identity document. At a later date, an excerpt from the execution and bankruptcy office can be requested and an updated judicial checkout with a maximum validity of 3 months. End of the competition: Friday 25 September 2026. Please fill in the online application attached to the competition. We'll check every file carefully.

 Application deadline:* 2026-09-26

Sector: Energy / Public Services

Sede: Via Industria 2, 6933 Muzzano (Lugano), TI, Switzerland

[Official note (PDF)](https://www.ail.ch/downloadJobPosition?uuid=7f7c88e2-d741-4d7-b872-59dcec8b70fc)

